      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The player is a journalist trying to examine the mysterious deaths of
    the Johnson

    family inside their manor. Upon entering, the house seals itself,
    revealing that the manor

    is bound by a powerful curse that traps both the
    souls of its victims and anyone who steps

    inside. The spirits of the family
    roam the manor, driven into aggression by the curse

    rather than evil. The
    goal of the player is to escape the manor, which can only be done by

    collecting
    certain items along the way.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d54c8783aaad4f538d6d344f45ba0bf, type: 2}
